Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:39:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] VPVulkan: persistent pipeline cache for the prewarm
 (vpvk_device_wait_compiles, parallel library queues, archive switch and
 inflight marker, recipe hit/miss counters, motion-variant recipes at
 creation)

